    "name": "Python program to find",
    "code": "# Python program to find\n# if a given corner string\n# is present at corners.\n \ndef isCornerPresent(str, corner) :\n \n    n = len(str)\n    cl = len(corner)\n \n    # If length of corner\n    # string is more, it\n    # cannot be present\n    # at corners.\n    if (n < cl) :\n        return False\n \n    # Return true if corner\n    # string is present at\n    # both corners of given\n    # string.\n    return ((str[: cl] == corner) and\n            (str[n - cl :] == corner))\n \n# Driver Code\nstr = \"geeksforgeeks\"\ncorner = \"geeks\"\nif (isCornerPresent(str, corner)) :\n    print (\"Yes\")\nelse :\n    print (\"No\")\n \n# This code is contributed by\n# Manish Shaw(manishshaw1)",
